# LF everywhere. The server and client are built on Linux (Dockerfiles, CI), and this stops a
# contributor's core.autocrlf from turning a one-line edit into a whole-file rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.vrm binary
*.glb binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.onnx binary
